EXT. SUNSET BLVD - DAY

A classic 1968 FORD MUSTANG cruises down the palm-lined avenue.

INT. DINER - CONTINUOUS

SARAH (30s) sits in a red leather booth, sipping a CAN OF COCA-COLA. 

She glances at her vintage ROLEX SUBMARINER watch.

SARAH
(to herself)
Time is running out before production begins.

She slides a manila folder across the table to MARCUS (40s), who opens it to reveal a map of CENTRAL PARK.
